# Scene1-3-28

; ========================================
; ●シーン１‐3‐28
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:1_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

; 1シーン丸々無音は長いのでBGM
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_42_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:那天晚上，<br>艾玛脚步虚浮地来到汉娜的牢房。|#0103Adv28_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:同屋的可可不在，<br>取而代之的是梅露露。|#0103Adv28_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:……艾玛小姐，你也来了。|#0103Adv28_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露在汉娜的床上，<br>摆放着几个少女的人偶。<br>这些应该都是她取下来的。|#0103Adv28_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那些人偶都是汉娜亲手制作的。|#0103Adv28_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露的人偶。<br>雪莉的人偶。<br>汉娜的人偶。|#0103Adv28_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛将属于自己的人偶，轻轻放在了它们的旁边。|#0103Adv28_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛紧紧按住胸口，<br>感受着那温暖而微弱的光芒。|#0103Adv28_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那是如此微小，<br>仿佛随时会消逝的希望之光。|#0103Adv28_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那是汉娜和雪莉留下的遗物。|#0103Adv28_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我们，确实是朋友啊——）|#0103Adv28_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她想起之前和汉娜的一段对话。|#0103Adv28_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

