[PrintTextModified Text:那个……我是在给艾玛做礼物，<br>希望能让你开心起来。|#0103Adv28_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为艾玛你最近一直卧床，<br>我就想给你做些东西，当作是慰问品……|#0103Adv28_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜移开视线，<br>有些不好意思地说道。|#0103Adv28_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
