[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛小姐……|#0103Adv28_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露的手轻轻触碰艾玛的肩膀，<br>而压抑已久的情感终于决堤。|#0103Adv28_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆号泣

[PrintTextModified Text:呜哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！|#0103Adv28_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆号泣

[PrintTextModified Text:啊啊啊啊，啊啊啊啊啊啊！|#0103Adv28_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛紧紧抱住梅露露，<br>像小孩子一样放声大哭。|#0103Adv28_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而梅露露则一直，<br>一直轻抚着她的背。|#0103Adv28_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

